Those  cases  happened  in  2020
and  2021,  and  others  were

00:13:36.309 --> 00:13:41.070
dismantled  afterwards,  more
recently,  like  the  Matrix  platform.

00:13:42.090 --> 00:13:46.669
Some  of  this  encrypted  communication
service  included  also  modified

00:13:46.669 --> 00:13:52.990
