And  so  this  cross -border  police  operation
that  targeted  those  networks,  they

00:14:06.009 --> 00:14:12.830
included  not  only  EU  member  states,  France,
Belgium,  Netherlands,  but  also  the  US.

00:14:13.070 --> 00:14:19.850
So  it  was  an  international  enterprise.
What  does  those  cases  reveal?

00:14:20.090 --> 00:14:26.490
They  reveal  two  new  practices  of  police
cooperation  against  encrypted  networks  and  devices.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:31.769
First,  a  mass  hacking
approach,  whereby  communications

00:14:31.769 --> 00:14:35.529
data  are  obtained  in  a  general
and  indiscriminate  manner.

00:14:36.529 --> 00:14:43.409
That  is  to  say,  all  users  are  subjected  to
bulk  hacking  without  any  kind  of  discrimination.

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:48.070
Everybody  is  caught  in  the
fishing  net,  which  means  that  this

00:14:48.070 --> 00:14:51.929
principle  of  individualized
suspicion  for  the  right  to  a  fair

00:14:51.929 --> 00:14:56.009
trial  and  for  the  presumption  of
innocence  is  just  thrown  in  a  bin.

00:14:56.730 --> 00:15:02.809
Second,  they  are  laundering  these
extremely  intrusive  measures,  and  often

00:15:02.809 --> 00:15:07.110
illegal,  actually,  under  national
law,  through  forum  shopping  tactic.

00:15:07.490 --> 00:15:11.669
Forum  shopping,  what  it  is,  it
means  that  we  take  the  country  among

00:15:11.669 --> 00:15:16.009
the  group  of  partners,  of  partner
