out  this  intrusive  measure,  and

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:30.269
then  the  data  collected  from  this
operation  is  then  redistributed  among

00:15:30.269 --> 00:15:35.470
partner  countries  through  European
and  international  cooperation  channels.

00:15:35.789 --> 00:15:40.490
This  way,  the  data  is  laundered,
and  it  becomes  very  difficult

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:44.389
