it  does.  And  this  is  an  issue.

00:39:39.690 --> 00:39:43.469
We  need  to  talk  to  people  in  a  really  different
way  and  we  need  to  bring  new  people  to  the

00:39:43.469 --> 00:39:43.750
table.

00:39:43.949 --> 00:39:48.949
Because  the  other  big  issue  is  that  often
the  people  most  affected  by  surveillance  are

00:39:48.949 --> 00:39:53.309
some  of  the  most  vulnerable  communities  that
are  never  in  policy  spaces,  that  are  maybe

00:39:53.309 --> 00:39:53.929
