00:39:53.929 --> 00:39:56.489
So  this  is  the  other  big
task  and  the  big  learn,

00:39:56.610 --> 00:39:59.550
I  think,  from  the  chat
control  campaign  where

00:39:59.550 --> 00:40:03.429
we  have  managed  to  mobilize  really,  really
different  communities,  including,  for  example,

00:40:03.590 --> 00:40:09.489
sex  workers,  trans  people,  children,  young
people,  vulnerable  people  also  in  that  sense

00:40:09.489 --> 00:40:12.909
were  never  really  represented.  So  this
is  the  other  big  learning  that  we  have.

00:40:13.369 --> 00:40:16.630
